cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: MSigDB Hallmark and GO:BP gene sets (H, MH, C5 GO:BP, M5 GO:BP) and chip files
abstract: Differential expression between groups of bulk RNA-seq samples with PyDESeq2 (DESeq2's negative binomial model)
  for an additive design of sample-sheet columns, with shrunk fold changes, a PCA of variance-stabilised counts, volcano and
  MA plots, and preranked GSEA on MSigDB Hallmark and GO biological process gene sets. Reads rnaseq-quant output or deposited
  count tables (featureCounts, RSEM, htseq-count, STAR, genes x samples CSV/TSV/XLSX) with a sample sheet or SPARC metadata.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/MSigDB Hallmark and GO:BP gene sets (H, MH, C5 GO:BP, M5 GO:BP) and chip
  files
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
